      "quote_id": "7fc6d2da4b0307b6adbcd9b44aa0b9714655d9a0879ac76158caa26e12381bc2",
      "quote_text": "It is always important in matters of high politics to know what you do not know. Those who think that they know, but are mistaken, and act upon their mistakes, are the most dangerous people to have in charge.",
      "review_note": ""
    },
    {
